    <Fragment slot='caption'>
      "use client" defines where the server hands off, not which component is interactive. The
      directive marks an entry point into the client module graph: everything reachable from it
      ships to the browser, directive or not. That downstream import graph is the cost of a
      boundary, which is why placement is an architectural decision.
